#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:23 931eac0c353348c6aa4869183089a9cf
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectRecord captures audio data passing through an audio bus and records it to an "
"internal buffer. When recording is complete, the captured audio can be saved as an "
":ref:`AudioStreamWAV<class_AudioStreamWAV>` resource."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectRecord**    是一个通过型录音 DSP。它不会改变总线输出，而是在    ``recording_active``    "
"启用时把经过效果器的音频写入内部缓冲。停止录制后，可以通过    ``get_recording()``    得到   "
":ref:`AudioStreamWAV<class_AudioStreamWAV>`  ，也可以通过    ``get_waveform_snapshot()``    获取波形预览数据。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:25 89d8aed0ad5a478cbfa3f86f51d21038
msgid ""
"This effect is useful for recording gameplay audio, capturing microphone input (when applied to a"
" microphone bus), or creating audio samples from synthesized sounds."
msgstr "可用于录制游戏音频、捕获麦克风总线输入，或从合成声音中制作音频样本。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:27 dac0e38ea66e4e0b9529dc555f543e4b
msgid ""
"To start recording, apply the effect to an audio bus and set "
":ref:`recording_active<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_property_recording_active>` to ``true``. To "
"stop, set :ref:`recording_active<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_property_recording_active>` to "
"``false`` and call :ref:`get_recording()<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_method_get_recording>` to "
"retrieve the recorded audio as an :ref:`AudioStreamWAV<class_AudioStreamWAV>`."
msgstr ""
"将效果器应用到音频总线，并将    :ref:`recording_active<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_property_recording_active>`"
"    设为    ``true``    即可开始录音。将    "
":ref:`recording_active<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_property_recording_active>`    设为    ``false``"
"    后，调用    :ref:`get_recording()<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_method_get_recording>`   ，以    "
":ref:`AudioStreamWAV<class_AudioStreamWAV>`    获取录音。"

