#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:14 1819d1b11dc3455480922545bf637847
msgid "Captures audio passing through a bus and exposes it as a WAV resource."
msgstr "捕获流经总线的音频，并以 WAV 资源提供录音。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:100 e8cd2c8df6b445189a7301ca7a2bffa7
msgid ""
"IMA ADPCM request value. The current implementation exports 16-bit PCM WAV data for this "
"setting; it does not encode IMA ADPCM."
msgstr "IMA ADPCM 请求值。当前实现对此设置导出 16 位 PCM WAV 数据，不执行 IMA ADPCM 编码。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:122 03f1e47e03ff4481829261ccbb01630a
msgid ""
"The sample format used when "
":ref:`get_recording()<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_method_get_recording>` exports the captured"
" floating-point samples. Changing it does not change the capture buffer. "
":ref:`FORMAT_IMA_ADPCM<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_constant_FORMAT_IMA_ADPCM>` currently "
"exports 16-bit PCM, like "
":ref:`FORMAT_16_BITS<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_constant_FORMAT_16_BITS>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`get_recording()<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_method_get_recording>`  "
"导出已捕获浮点采样时使用的采样格式。修改它不会改变捕获缓冲。 "
":ref:`FORMAT_IMA_ADPCM<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_constant_FORMAT_IMA_ADPCM>`  当前与  "
":ref:`FORMAT_16_BITS<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_constant_FORMAT_16_BITS>`  一样导出 16 位 PCM。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:156 68f44fe282b842f2a0c0859d82e77dc0
msgid ""
"Starts or stops recording. Changing from inactive to active clears the previous recording and"
" allocates a new capture buffer. Setting the current state again does nothing. Stopping "
"preserves captured samples for "
":ref:`get_recording()<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_method_get_recording>`."
msgstr ""
"开始或停止录音。从停止切换到录音会清除上一次录音并分配新的捕获缓冲；重复设置当前状态没有效果。停止后保留已捕获采样，供  "
":ref:`get_recording()<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_method_get_recording>`  读取。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:204 0e5385d7b548412293b6b75ee4e862b2
msgid ""
"Returns a new :ref:`AudioStreamWAV<class_AudioStreamWAV>` containing a copy of the captured "
"samples, or ``null`` if no audio has been recorded. It does not consume or clear the "
"recording. Stop recording first when a completed recording is required."
msgstr ""
"返回包含已捕获采样副本的新  :ref:`AudioStreamWAV<class_AudioStreamWAV>` ；尚无录音时返回  ``null`` "
"。读取不会消耗或清除录音。需要完整录音时，应先停止录制。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:216 52aad080ee8643eea7944311c5621819
msgid ""
"Returns a waveform envelope for the latest ``seconds`` of recorded audio. A nonpositive "
"duration uses the entire recording. For each of ``width`` horizontal buckets, two "
":ref:`Vector2<class_Vector2>` elements contain the normalized x position and the minimum or "
"maximum sample value, in that order. Channels are averaged and amplitudes are clamped to -1.0"
" through 1.0. Returns an empty array for a nonpositive width or no recorded audio; otherwise "
"the array has ``width * 2`` elements."
msgstr ""
"返回最近  ``seconds``  秒录音的波形包络；时长非正时使用全部录音。每个  ``width``  水平分桶返回两个  "
":ref:`Vector2<class_Vector2>` ，依次存放归一化的 x 位置和最小、最大采样值。各声道先取平均，幅度限制在 -1.0 到 "
"1.0。宽度非正或尚无录音时返回空数组，否则数组包含  ``width * 2``  个元素。"
